Package: xlum
Type: Package
Title: Read, Write, and Convert XLUM Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sebastian", "Kreutzer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer_luminescence@r-luminescence.org", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0734-2199")),
    person("Marco", "Colombo", role = c("aut"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6672-0623")),
    person("Christoph", "Burow", role = c("ctb"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5023-4046")))
Maintainer: Sebastian Kreutzer <maintainer_luminescence@r-luminescence.org>
Description: Support for the XLUM file format (Kreutzer et al. (2023)
    <doi:10.5194/gchron-5-271-2023>) for exchange and long-term
    preservation of luminescence data. The package facilitates the import
    and export of XLUM files and the conversion from other ASCII and binary
    formats commonly used to store luminescence (dating) data.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://r-lum.github.io/xlum/
BugReports: https://github.com/R-Lum/xlum/issues
